    "description": "A tiny branching conversation about spending coins. You start with 5 coins (shown at the top of the Play panel). Each menu item has a Requires, so anything you can't afford shows as locked with the price it needs, and water is always free. After each order Pip asks \"anything else?\" and the jump loops back to the menu. On the way out, a condition checks whether you have a coin left for the tip jar.",
